# Loads devShells.default from flake.nix: the native toolchain (clang,
# cmake, ninja, python3) for the server, tests and non-cross client
# presets. nix-direnv caches the evaluation, so this is near-instant
# after the first entry.
#
# The cross-compilation shell is deliberately NOT loaded here. Entering
# it automatically would put a Windows-targeting compiler in front of
# every native build in this directory. Build the Windows client with an
# explicit:
#   nix develop .#mingw --command cmake --preset windows-client-release
use flake
